        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(d) Solely for the purpose of granting vacation eligibility for a Term of Employment of six (8) months, twelve (12) months, and two (2) years, as provided in Paragraphs 1(a) and 1(c), an Employee hired or rehired on the first (1st) working day of a calendar month will have Term of Employment computed from the first (1st) calendar day of that month.",
