        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(f) An Employee reinstated from Leave of Absence or rehired from Layoff who has a Term of Employment of two (2) years or more and who was not previously on the roll in the current calendar year will be eligible to vacation with pay in the following amounts, applied to the number of days of vacation for his or her Term of Employment as determined in accordance with Paragraph 1(a) or 1(b):",
